You may use an unmodified copy at work and inside a business, as long as you do not charge for it.

You may distribute unmodified copies only free of charge, publicly or privately. Every copy must include this text and the copyright notice.

You may sell the program, or charge for it in any form (price, subscription, paid access), only if you distribute a version that you have modified. The version you sell must include your own substantial changes to the program's behavior. Renaming, swapping the icon, changing the identifier or version number, recompiling, or repackaging is not enough. Whoever receives the paid version must receive your modified version, not an unmodified copy of Bordi.

You may not sell, rent, sublicense, or charge for unmodified copies, nor offer a service whose content is only this program without the changes required above.

The original portions remain under this license. You may apply different terms to your own modifications, as long as you respect this license for the original portions.

